# Lesson 1 – KPIs, Metrics & Business Goals

## Key Concepts
- Business Goals
- KPIs
- Driver Metrics
- Operational Metrics
- North Star Metrics

## Interview Takeaways
- Always clarify the business objective before discussing metrics.
- KPIs measure progress toward business goals.
- Driver metrics explain KPI movement.

## Business Framework
Business Goal → KPI → Driver Metrics → Operational Metrics

## Biggest Lesson
Metrics without business context don't drive decisions.